    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11018" root="خطف" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُطُفٌ</span></b> : see what next precedes. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ خُطُفٌ</span>
(assumed tropical:)  <i>In him</i> (namely, a man, JK) <i>is madness,</i> or
<i>diabolical possession;</i> (JK, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُطَّفٌ</span></b> :
but this latter may be either a pl., like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُرَّبٌ</span> [pl.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَارِبٌ</span>], or a sing. (TA.)

